{"parse": {"title": "CO-17", "pageid": 100926, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/CO-16\" title=\"CO-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-17</span><a href=\"/wiki/CO-18\" title=\"CO-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">17</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.9B.87.E9.9D.A0.E6.98.9F.E6.98.9F.E8.AF.81.E6.98.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蛇靠星星证明\">蛇靠星星证明</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 蛇靠星星证明</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Measure of a Melusine</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蛇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>争<span class=\"color-value\"></span>先<span class=\"color-value\"></span>恐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>后<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>和<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>像<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>另<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>发<span class=\"color-value\"></span>烫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>心<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710117</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi1\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员还没来得及喘匀气，车辆没法直接开进发射场内圈，最后一小段路她是跑完的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她必须抓紧时间，她回到这里就是为了说出自己的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六比她更快地开口了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你没事吧？怎么看起来像连着熬了好几个通宵似的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>说过多少次，疯狂科学家那一套没什么好处，科研也是体力活——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-632914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-632914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-632914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我……回来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>最近我应该没做别的，就忙着手上这个要上天的大工程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢，车我用过，去矿坑附近跑了圈，没人查超载，没吃罚单，顶多油没加满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每个猜想都绕过了靶心，巧合得像知道正确答案后考出的零分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>和那些都没关系……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>早几天会更安全，你不该选今天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>“暴雨”很可能还有几个小时就会发生，你会来不及开车回分部大楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她干脆先沉默，直到调整好呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我来等着帮你们处理后事，顺便看看你们玩命拿到的数据究竟值不值得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>如果你们出事，正好。我把传送软盘改良好，用自己的名义发表论文，给研究成果起名，把你们的名字写在最不起眼的角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>一定说到做到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>能帮上忙就好。相信他们也不在意——别忘记用通灵板把论文结果告诉我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……你是在开玩笑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你不是认真的，指针？你学会了幽默？原谅我真的一点都没看出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她努力维持着的平静语气还是被摧毁了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我发现没有蔬菜包的泡面太难吃，简直无法容忍！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>你也让人无法容忍！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>别在任何时候都轻描淡写地说所有事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>吃饭很重要，生死不也很重要吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>说得轻松就能回避结果？少自以为是了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在彻底放弃控制音量，也放弃思考后，她的确从冷周六脸上见到了不一样的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>愧疚，悲伤，震惊？都不是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员只是收起了微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>还好我一直在往数据卡里备份研究资料！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个更快乐的、发自真心的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我考虑了很久应该把它托付给谁，就算冒着风险把它单独用传送术式送回去，也很可能会有意外和折损。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>还好你现在回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>薄薄的卡片再次递到她面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>可能缺了一些内容，含章鼎，我记住他叫什么了——还没来得及做完短片剪辑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不过遗书这种东西也不需要多么漂亮的结尾，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>要点是，必须托付给一个会认真对待它的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>现在开车回去还来得及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>数据卡有轻微的热度，它大概始终被装在口袋里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>开车也来不及，油箱快空了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>让我见识下你们的成果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你决定和我一起死了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针并没有接话，而是靠近了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我只是希望这份电子遗书不会派上用场，至少不是作为遗书派上用场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>说吧，你把我们的研究完善到了什么程度？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>目前只能实现定点传送，而且会造成不可避免的压力，带来眩晕、呕吐，和严重晕车类似——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>无所谓。等我读完研究资料，就会着手解决这些副作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>期待你的好消息！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指了指门口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你的实验室谁都没再进去过，也没动过里面的东西。我的实验室倒是变得乱七八糟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>在这里用传送软盘不太安全，万一你把发射台一起带走，或者哪台机器出了故障，我们就完蛋啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我当然知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>不需要更多帮手了？我可以留下帮忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我以为那天我们已经决定好了分工方式，你留在绝对安全的地方保护资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她难以分辨其中是否有嘲讽的成分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她也不需要对此追根究底。语言就是这样模糊而缥缈，被说出的话都会折损意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>那就这样。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_guanmen.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_guanmen\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_guanmen\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_7_at_guanmen.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_guanmen.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_7_at_guanmen.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_guanmen.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_7_at_guanmen.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_guanmen.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>临转身前，她顿了顿，顺手将头发别到耳后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>数据接口与机械装置折射着实验室的冷光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我本以为机器无法忤逆自己的程序。它教导我以保护周围的生命为先。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>但我们还是在这里见面了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又是一个少见的表情。指针的数据库得出了分析结果，对方感到惊讶。但这种情绪也并未在冷周六脸上停留太久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你能尝出普通食物的味道？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针以为自己的表情数据已经不会再被奇妙的问题干扰。但她的微笑指数依然上升了0.35度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我的设计目的之一就是尽可能地仿真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>仿真？谁规定人类和神秘学家是“真实”的标准？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>按他们那套分类，你大概算是“意识唤醒者”，就像乌尔里希研究员和露西女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>可能不太一样。不过，还是等事情顺利结束后再说这些吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>看来多精密的计算也无法准确预估所有事。就像我本以为在这样的时刻，你会鼓励你的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我的确在鼓励你。我在试着证明你的存在性……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对稍微偏过头、神情疑惑的研究员，指针的微笑指数再次上升。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自她离开发射基地以来，这是她最为轻松的一刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我该走了。多保重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……好吧，我也得继续做准备，多确认几次情况，保证别出岔子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这条走廊早就刻在了指针的脑子里，闭着眼都能摸清楚方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>快到转角时，她听见了呼喊声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>——指针！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我刚来普列谢茨克的时候，跟你简单解释过我的种族，但那真的很简略！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>吕西尼昂的大街小巷都有关于蛇发女妖的雕像！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我很早就离开了那里，但我相信它们还在，即使被“暴雨”冲刷也会在那儿，因为它的历史还算长！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你可以去看看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>去那里根本找不到理由报销差旅费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没有停下脚步，也没有回头，只是比了个手势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">指针。拉普拉斯科算中心普列谢茨克分部研究员，前航天小组成员。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">退出计划的原因，得有人为坏结局做好准备，帮忙收场。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">另外，那碗面真的很难吃。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这儿也有两位朋友在进行简单的告别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管无法依靠语言交换祝愿，她们还是尽量做着尝试。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_huahuanyuanlv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远旅还不太能控制好这支记号笔。但她写得非常缓慢，非常耐心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手掌上的笔迹组成一个复杂难辨的图形，它的几何构成非常精巧，它的含义也仍旧不可识读。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>阿涅娅。回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小宇航员的注意力暂时从图案上离开。她接连来了几次深呼吸，确认自己没有听错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>你居然说了这么长的话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>如果你能学会更长的句子，就能告诉我你的家乡在哪里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鞋面上增加了微不可察的丁点重量。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环低下头，一条小蛇也正抬头瞧她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div><b><i><span style=\"font-size:94%\">姐姐让我来提醒你，该登上飞船了。</span></i></b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div><b><i><span style=\"font-size:94%\">别害怕。我们九个都觉得你很厉害。</span></i></b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我完全没有害怕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>等我回来就给你们做特色果酱。是马戏团里的秘方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许是那个图形真有什么奇妙的效果，又或者是对未来平添的几分期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脚步确实轻快了起来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_cangshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_cangshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_cangshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-2_7_bg_cangshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_cangshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-2_7_bg_cangshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_cangshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-2_7_bg_cangshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_cangshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>登船检测完毕，没有问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>预计一分钟后正式进入发射准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>有让人始终保持冷静的好办法吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-311616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-311616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-311616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>有。坚持呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-311702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这是一句提醒，还是一个玩笑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-311615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-311615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-311615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>算是祝福。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>抓紧时间就位。一路顺风。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi1\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯结束。冷周六环视过发射室里的每张面孔，同伴们的神色令她稍感放松。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里没有想要退缩的人。她将手掌覆上那枚按钮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>三。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>二。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>一。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"557\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"112\" data-file-height=\"104\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>发射。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-17"}}